OL,3,GNEWSAHow to avoid breaking down in
OL,4,Aextreme weather
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers should be prepared for forecast
OL,7,Fthundery showers following the recent
OL,8,Fheatwave, a motoring organisation has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FThe Hampshire-based AA said it saw an
OL,12,Fincrease in roadside recoveries due to
OL,13,Fextreme heat, with flat batteries,
OL,14,Fcooling system breakdowns and tyre
OL,15,Ftrouble among recent issues.
OL,17,FDuring what is on course to be the
OL,18,Fhottest summer on record, warmer road
OL,19,Fsurfaces, long journeys and vehicles
OL,20,Fheavily loaded with luggage were blamed
OL,21,Ffor an increase in calls.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
